Repository: https://github.com/Modolet/gpui_xterm
Published source commit: 4c007c1740f91cf3e35550beadba1384feba8caf
The original copyright and license are retained in LICENSE.

Hive modifications:
- Adapt to the application's fixed gpui-kit 0.9.0 (gpui-pre 0.3.11).
- Remove owned I/O threads, arbitrary readers/writers, PTY assumptions and flume.
- Expose synchronous feed/reset/resize, input enablement and typed GPUI events.
- Use GPUI clipboard for explicit user copy/paste; ignore OSC 52 clipboard requests.
- Handle macOS/Windows clipboard shortcuts and bracketed paste from native mode.
- Forward native terminal replies; retain real grid, selection and IME rendering.
- Replace upstream tests with a focused parser/protocol self-check.
- Correct inherited IME selected/marked UTF-16 ranges and preedit wide-cell positions.
- Consume handled keys once; support inverse/hidden cells, wide-cell backgrounds,
  combining marks and the terminal cursor visibility mode in the renderer.
- Route macOS Return/control keys before printable text/IME deferral, while
  keeping composition navigation out of shell input; use real platform mono fonts.
